WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Worksight. Synthetic UI demo. No ML inference or performance claims.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Create a profile for the part and camera view.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Preview a verified good sample before uploading it. This example image is synthetic.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Upload the sample and build profile v1. The demo simulates the build job.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Upload a new part image for inspection. Demo results are fixed regardless of input.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Review the original with an illustrative heatmap. Processing time is not reported.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Adjust opacity and compare the part against the similar reference.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Record Fail as the human decision. The model decision remains Needs review.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Request profile v2. The earlier inspection still uses v1. No quality improvement is claimed.

10
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Inspect again. The new result now refers to profile v2.

11
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The same inspection workspace adapts to a phone viewport.

12
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Live FastAPI and AMD validation are pending backend integration.

